---
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Hot Tapping - Velcorix Services" description="Safe and efficient hot tapping and line stopping services for live pipelines in UAE. Velcorix enables modifications and tie-ins without system shutdowns or product loss.">
<!-- Header (Hero) -->
    <PageHeader 
      title="Hot Tapping Services" 
      subtitle="Live Pipeline Intervention without Shutdown" 
      bgImage="/assets/images/services/DSC_2341.JPG" 
    />

    <!-- Overview (Intro) -->
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <img
              src="/assets/images/services/DSC_2345.JPG"
              class="img-fluid shadow intro-image"
              alt="Hot Tapping"
              onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/800x400?text=Hot+Tapping'"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 mb-4">
            <h2 class="mb-3">Keep the Flow Going</h2>
            <p>
              In today's continuously operating industrial facilities, shutting down a pipeline for modifications is often not an option. Hot tapping (under-pressure drilling) allows for new tie-ins to be made while the system remains in full operation.
            </p>
            <p>
              Velcorix provides world-class hot tapping and line stopping services, enabling clients to expand, repair, or modify piping systems without service interruption, product loss, or environmental risk.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

